.TH PACTUI 1 "2026-08-10" "pacfz 1.1.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pactui \- interactive terminal UI for exploring installed pacman packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pactui
[\-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pactui
is a third TUI front\-end built with the Textual framework, sharing the exact same query engine and cache as
.BR pacfz (1)
and
.BR pacq (1).
Unlike
.BR pacfz (1),
it does not use
.BR fzf (1)
and is not driven by command\-line flags; instead, it presents a full\-screen, mouse\-and\-keyboard\-driven terminal user interface with feature parity to
.BR pacfz (1)
and
.BR pacq (1).
.PP
.B pactui
requires
.I python\-textual
to be installed; this is an optional dependency of the
.I pacfz
package, not a hard requirement.
.SH INTERFACE
A single search\-and\-preview view: a free\-text search bar and a dropdown for which field to search sit together at the top, the results table and a full colorized metadata preview of the highlighted package fill the middle, and a row of facet filters (foreign, orphan, dependency status, required\-by, optional\-for, notes) sits along the bottom, similarly to
.BR pacfz (1)'s
own filter flags.
.PP
Both the top search row and the bottom filter row scroll horizontally on their own when the terminal is too narrow to show everything at once.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the installed pacfz version and exit, without launching the interface.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.TP
.B /
Focus the search bar.
.TP
.BR j / k
Move the highlighted row down or up in the results table.
.TP
.B g
Jump to the top of the results table.
.TP
.B G
Jump to the bottom of the results table.
.TP
.B ctrl+r
Rebuild the package cache in the background and refresh the visible results.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
.PP
Every action is also reachable with the mouse: click a table row to select it, click a filter control to toggle it, click and type in the search bar or field dropdown directly.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal exit, either via
.B q
or
.BR \-\-version .
.TP
.B 1
.I python\-textual
is not installed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PACFZ_DB_PATH
Overrides the package cache DB path outright. Default:
.IR $XDG_CACHE_HOME/pacman_packages.db .
.TP
.B PACFZ_NOTES_DB_PATH
Overrides the notes DB path outright. Default:
.IR $XDG_DATA_HOME/pacfz/user_data.db .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cache/pacman_packages.db
The package metadata cache, shared with
.BR pacfz (1)
and
.BR pacq (1).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/pacfz/user_data.db
Per\-package user notes, shared with the other two front\-ends.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pacfz (1),
.BR pacq (1),
.BR pacman (8)
.SH AUTHOR
marco-l
